    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHASERS is an Urban Fantasy Collectible RPG set against the conflict between the sky city of Aluna, which monopolizes the power of the sun, and the resistance forces of the surface, Line.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mediator, assemble your own team and join the battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Diverse Characters and Growth System</strong> <br>Collect unique characters, develop their abilities, and strengthen your team. Each character has a distinct story and skillset, allowing for strategic combinations in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Strategic Combat System</strong> <br>Swap characters in real-time, utilizing skills and attributes to defeat enemies. Experience the thrill of precise dodging and timing to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/3ed380b92fd357a1e679e0d9d3cf1852.poster.avif?t=1741253752\" width=684 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/3ed380b92fd357a1e679e0d9d3cf1852.webm?t=1741253752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/3ed380b92fd357a1e679e0d9d3cf1852.mp4?t=1741253752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Immersive Worldbuilding</strong> <br>Explore the captivating story of Aluna and the resistance forces, uncovering secrets across diverse cities and mysterious locations. The journey to uncover the truth behind the sun's power awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/8380b67e04f38494d6bb36a28d181b42.poster.avif?t=1741253752\" width=788 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/8380b67e04f38494d6bb36a28d181b42.webm?t=1741253752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/8380b67e04f38494d6bb36a28d181b42.mp4?t=1741253752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Variety of Game Content</strong> <br>Enjoy main story missions, challenge modes, PvP battles, and mini-games! With monthly updates adding new events and characters, there\u2019s always something to look forward to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
