img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/8380b67e04f38494d6bb36a28d181b42.poster.avif?t=1741253752\" width=788 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/8380b67e04f38494d6bb36a28d181b42.webm?t=1741253752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367010/extras/8380b67e04f38494d6bb36a28d181b42.mp4?t=1741253752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Variety of Game Content</strong> <br>Enjoy main story missions, challenge modes, PvP battles, and mini-games! With monthly updates adding new events and characters, there\u2019s always something to look forward to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
